Resources of the reference Closure Compiler jar (Apache-2.0), stored verbatim as data:
externs/ holds the entries of the jar's externs.zip (Bazel rule externs_zip, built from
the reference checkout's externs/**/*.js with the externs/ prefix stripped);
com/google/javascript/jscomp/js/ holds the runtime JS libraries (from
src/com/google/javascript/jscomp/js/) plus the Bazel-generated polyfills.txt and
transpilation_libs.txt; runtime_libs.typedast is the Bazel-generated typed AST of the runtime
libraries. Regenerate everything (data, src/jar_contents.rs, tests/fixtures/jar_manifest.tsv) with
  python3 crates/resources/tools/sync_from_jar.py <closure-compiler.jar> <reference/closure-compiler>
